WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:02,000
Wanwan, why are you crying?

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,000
I'm fine, Mr. Xu

3
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:06,200
He just looks so much like his father

4
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:07,920
Think of my weak self

5
00:00:07,920 --> 00:00:09,760
When my father faced loss

6
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:11,200
Didn't help anything

7
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,960
My father was lost and killed like this.

8
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:16,700
And getting along with Mr. Xu

9
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:18,020
I discovered how you make me feel

10
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:19,860
Feels very much like my father

11
00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:21,140
I am conscious

12
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:22,900
I thought of my father again

13
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:26,330
Mr. Xu, although it is a bit offensive

14
00:00:26,330 --> 00:00:28,890
But can you allow me to call you daddy?
